at":"2026-03-09T09:01:38Z","git_url":"git://github.com/elastic/kibana.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:elastic/kibana.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/elastic/kibana.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/elastic/kibana","homepage":"https://www.elastic.co/products/kibana","size":13528761,"stargazers_count":20989,"watchers_count":20989,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":8541,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":13149,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["dashboards","elasticsearch","hacktoberfest","kibana","metrics","observability","visualizations"],"visibility":"public","forks":8541,"open_issues":13149,"watchers":20989,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Kibana version:** 6.4.0\r\n**Elasticsearch version:** 6.4.0\r\n**Describe the bug:**\r\nThere are 16TB+/150+Bil indices in ES, also on fields with very high cardinality such as `uid`. \r\nIf turn on autocomplete feature, then input `uid:` in search bar, kibana would send this query to ES:\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"size\": 0,\r\n  \"timeout\": \"1s\",\r\n  \"terminate_after\": 100000,\r\n  \"query\": {\r\n    \"match_all\": {\r\n      \"boost\": 1.0\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"aggregations\": {\r\n    \"suggestions\": {\r\n      \"terms\": {\r\n        \"field\": \"uid\",\r\n        \"size\": 10,\r\n        \"shard_size\": 10,\r\n        \"min_doc_count\": 1,\r\n        \"shard_min_doc_count\": 0,\r\n        \"show_term_doc_count_error\": false,\r\n        \"execution_hint\": \"map\",\r\n        \"order\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"_count\": \"desc\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"_key\": \"asc\"\r\n          }\r\n        ],\r\n        \"include\": \".*\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIt will load 160GB+ fielddata to memory, then ES OOM.\r\nCan we have better way to implement this suggestion function to avoid load too much fielddata memory?\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/kibana/issues/29146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/kibana/issues/29146/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]